# KUDEX AGENT ENVIRONMENT RULES
ENFORCE: Next.js 16, React 19, TypeScript 7.
ENFORCE: Viem @latest, Wagmi @latest, TanStack Query v5.
ENFORCE: BigInt for all Wei, POT, and token math.
ENFORCE: 14 decimals for native POT calculations.
ENFORCE: `as const` on all contract ABIs.
ENFORCE: `react-icons` for all iconography. Never render emojis.
ENFORCE: Semantic Tailwind design tokens. No inline hex colors.
REJECT: Ethers.js (v5/v6), Web3.js, deprecated Wagmi v1 hooks.
REJECT: Floating-point math on on-chain values.
